---
import StoryIcon from "../homepage/StoryIcon.astro";
import TradeCharacterAlt from "../homepage/TradeCharacterAlt.astro";
---
<section class="sb-spotlight" aria-labelledby="client-spotlight-title">
  <div class="sb-shell sb-spotlight__grid">
    <div class="sb-spotlight__visual sb-spotlight__visual--illustration"><TradeCharacterAlt /></div>
    <div class="sb-spotlight__copy"><p><StoryIcon name="storefront" />Discovering a local business on Chakusa</p><h2 id="client-spotlight-title">Find a business, see real availability, and book in a few taps.</h2><blockquote><p>Every listing is a real business's own public profile, its own services, its own prices, its own calendar. There's no bidding for placement and no sponsored ranking pushing one business above another.</p><p>Reviews are ungated: any customer who completes a visit can leave one, not just the ones a business chooses to ask. If you'd rather talk first, you can message the business directly before booking.</p></blockquote><footer><span><strong>Ungated reviews</strong><small>Never filtered by expected rating</small></span><span><strong>Direct messaging</strong><small>Talk to the business, not a call center</small></span></footer></div>
  </div>
</section>
